  "design": "Observed fast recorded-FGA probability = theta_player * source_model_survival_event. MAP theta has Beta(1+kappa*mu,1+kappa*(1-mu)) prior, mu=total successes/sum survival, solved by monotone derivative bisection. Common kappa minimizes five whole-game fold Bernoulli NLL. Counts and contextual survival only; no simulated residual, name, rank, ON/OFF or wins fit. Survival uses full-season v22 shooting/turnover covariates and coarse engine foul/endgame assumptions, so descriptive conditional reconstruction, not blind or causal skill estimation. Runtime unchanged; source choice physics centering and residual policy mismatches must be audited before integration.",
